          "seriestitle": "The Solar System",
          "description": "Check out this free preview of a brand new Yoto Original - The Solar System! \n\nKat and Jamal are in their last year of Solar System Space Camp. Their final mission? A scavenger hunt around all eight planets.\n\nThe most familiar of all the planets to Kat and Jamal (and you!), it is of course, Earth! But have you ever gazed upon it from the moon? Neither had Kat and Jamal, so that’s exactly what they decide to do. Join them as they bounce around on the moon whilst learning why our planet, and the life upon it, is nothing short of a miracle. \n\nDiscover: Listen to a snippet for free.\nFull Pack: The Solar System is available in the card store now. \nAvailable: Until the end of May. ",
